        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime Elevated Residential Sites For Sale – Earlspark, Ballinasloe, Co. Roscommon\r\n\r\nTwo attractive residential sites of approximately 1 acre each are being sold separately , subject to planning permission, located at Earlspark, Ballinasloe, Co. Roscommon.\r\n\r\nSet in a gorgeous peaceful rural setting overlooking surrounding farmland, these elevated sites enjoy excellent road frontage along a quiet cul-de-sac road, offering privacy, tranquillity and beautiful countryside views.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned approximately 6km from Ballinasloe on the old Dublin Road, the sites benefit from easy access to the M6 motorway, providing convenient commuting to Athlone, Galway and Dublin.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for those seeking to build a family home in a scenic countryside location while remaining close to local amenities and transport links.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\nApprox. 1 acre sites x 2 \r\nSold separately\r\nBeing sold subject to planning permission\r\nElevated sites with panoramic countryside views\r\nExcellent road frontage\r\nQuiet cul de sac location\r\nPeaceful rural setting\r\nClose to Padraig Pearses GAA Club\r\nConvenient access to M6 motorway\r\nEasy commute to Athlone, Galway and Dublin\r\nNearest Eircode for reference: H53 T886\r\n\r\nFolio Numbers:\r\n\r\nRN20948F A1N5P\r\nRN20948F A1N5Q\r\nPrice: On Application\r\n\r\nFor further information contact:\r\nKevin O’Flynn"
